{
  "uid": "secrets-resilience",
  "title": "Secrets — can the platform survive losing its store?",
  "tags": [
    "security",
    "secrets",
    "mdapi"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "links": [],
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 36,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "version": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The question worth asking of any secrets store is not whether it is up, but whether you can leave it.** These gauges come from drills that actually exercise the alternative path: the OpenBao failover is rehearsed, not documented.\n\n`ESO synced` proves External Secrets can reconcile from the alternative store. `Windmill parity` proves the automation sees the same values through it — a store that answers but returns different content is worse than one that is down, because nothing fails loudly.\n\n⭐ Snapshots and archives are separate on purpose: a Raft snapshot restores the store, the archive restores the *contents* if the store itself is the thing you no longer trust."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failover check",
      "description": "The most recent rehearsal of the alternative path completed.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(openbao_failover_check_last_run_success)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "YES",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
